abstract: "IaC-Guard-V is a fail-closed verifier for infrastructure-as-code security repairs and explicitly selected candidate properties. It binds scanner, parser, source, resource, relationship, before/after, and deterministic local Helm evidence for supported Terraform and Kubernetes workflows."
